      "updated": 1795000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The happy path of a new site. Every run-agent call below is its own durable Inngest step (guard-input, builder-model-N, gate-check-N, gate-browse-N…).\nA follow-up runs the editor loop instead. Memory, browser and email failures are skipped, never fatal.",
      "originalText": "The happy path of a new site. Every run-agent call below is its own durable Inngest step (guard-input, builder-model-N, gate-check-N, gate-browse-N…).\nA follow-up runs the editor loop instead. Memory, browser and email failures are skipped, never fatal.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
